{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3438640/extras/6bd7fd2220a3549459104f8226041c38.webp?t=1773641109\" width=600 height=39 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3438640/extras/404446c811d1770aca547ddd8238c82f.poster.avif?t=1773641109\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3438640/extras/404446c811d1770aca547ddd8238c82f.webm?t=1773641109\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3438640/extras/404446c811d1770aca547ddd8238c82f.mp4?t=1773641109\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take command of turn\u2011based battles in a charming roguelite where you control <strong>both sides</strong> of the fight. Decide when to play your dice \u2014 and your enemy\u2019s \u2014 to shape the outcome of every turn.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3438640/extras/0f1655302dcdc3bd7ac615765d0da55b.webp?t=1773641109\" width=600 height=39 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3438640/extras/505f141cd6f5d28128db0ec5d7c0cb1f.poster.avif?t=1773641109\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3438640/extras/505f141cd6f5d28128db0ec5d7c0cb1f.webm?t=1773641109\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3438640/extras/505f141cd6f5d28128db0ec5d7c0cb1f.mp4?t=1773641109\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Capture weakened foes mid\u2011battle to recruit them into your team or save them for future runs. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3438640/extras/461afca8726c004ce671f8186195be60.webp?t=1773641109\" width=600 height=39 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3438640/extras/1dd55ee3a8a91b862fac03fe56793e5a.poster.avif?t=1773641109\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3438640/extras/1dd55ee3a8a91b862fac03fe56793e5a.webm?t=1773641109\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3438640/extras/1dd55ee3a8a91b862fac03fe56793e5a.mp4?t=1773641109\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Assemble your squad from recruited bugs and customize your starting dice for endless strategic possibilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3438640/extras/7c33106ca3c0465ddbe94005addd3823.webp?t=1773641109\" width=600 height=39 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3438640/extras/e4f55208fd05ba7fc2546532bf10ff8f.poster.avif?t=1773641109\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3438640/extras/e4f55208fd05ba7fc2546532bf10ff8f.webm?t=1773641109\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3438640/extras/e4f55208fd05ba7fc2546532bf10ff8f.mp4?t=1773641109\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new abilities, chain attacks, and equip complementary gear to create powerful team synergies. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3438640/extras/f14bc67f95fba5cab53b51ad9ccbb361.webp?t=1773641109\" width=600 height=39 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3438640/extras/d6770bad8202535a5bd053a58f47307f.poster.avif?t=1773641109\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3438640/extras/d6770bad8202535a5bd053a58f47307f.webm?t=1773641109\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3438640/extras/d6770bad8202535a5bd053a58f47307f.mp4?t=1773641109\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spend your hard\u2011earned coins in the shop to upgrade units, tweak your dice, and expand your tactical options.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3438640/extras/d227f151b89df019e56a19cb180c8826.webp?t=1773641109\" width=600 height=39 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3438640/extras/d1228551db1c65cd1594183df7b277f8.avif?t=1773641109\" width=600 height=262 /></span></p> <p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With every run, your collection of bugs and dice grows, offering fresh combinations and new ways to outwit your opponents. Whether you\u2019re here for casual fun or deep strategy, <i>Dicey Bugs</i> lets you roll toward victory \u2014 your way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3438640/extras/9bee5ff422cd8f69d1198e47eb2dcbb5.avif?t=1773641109\" width=600 height=200 /></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"I Did a Thing!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3438640/c85a9efd46ff68bae872c8a4ce591dc5c2344a79.jpg"},{"name":"You Call That a Challenge?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3438640/0643c9de9fb2a65ee0594d2f3ed445339fe2f1f5.jpg"},{"name":"They Said It Can't Be Done!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3438640/244f4c193262fb1d09e504f6ae7c768e2106eed0.jpg"},{"name":"Ride or Die","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3438640/e1de23bc8a2a72eda8f64db3c52c3ae7343bd0a7.jpg"},{"name":"Insecticide","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3438640/ce825d6170e563d205c05f8dd5f75c53d1f9b4c5.jpg"},{"name":"I'm Invincible!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3438640/caef2cbfbe7f08f3b0460269ac17070a9145648d.jpg"},{"name":"Window Shopper","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3438640/67625c4d0bd5dd9a6a4300939c31fa8966e49604.jpg"},{"name":"Buggin' Out","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3438640/90fb4bc3fb70988414c17af3209e9f17bac072bf.jpg"},{"name":"Facelift","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3438640/e43129aaae4aff6b6c52a64eb9b5246d0eb4b47c.jpg"},{"name":"Infinite Money Glitch","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3438640/8296d85cd3a34114ad6df381b6b0d94bebbedc17.jpg"}],"total":65},"background":"